OxyOS's system sounds (/usr/share/sounds/oxyos, docs/adr/0044-system-sounds.mdx)

The Trash's and the notification's sounds were supplied by the OxyOS owner for OxyOS on
5 November 2026. No other provenance was given with them, and no ownership or relicensing of
them is asserted here. Their licence must be resolved with the repository's before any release
(README.md). The screenshot's shutter is the freedesktop.org sound theme's, under its own
licence (below). The poof's sound was synthesized for OxyOS from nothing but a script of the
repository's (below), on 6 November 2026.

stereo/trash-empty.oga (and stereo/file-trash.oga, a link to it: one sound for putting items
in the Trash and for emptying it)
  Source: "Empty-trash-sound-effect.mp3", MP3, 128 kb/s, 44.1 kHz stereo, 0.84 s,
          13374 bytes, SHA-256
          ff9c157ce25dcff682cd5894d274569005d98ca9826f1e3309004c9722d7a15c
  Made:   scripts/import-system-sound.py SOURCE trash-empty.oga --threshold -80
          The source decoded to 16-bit PCM (ffmpeg 7.1.5); the 25.9 ms of silence before the
          sound (the MP3 encoder's delay) and the 151.9 ms after it, below -80 dBFS, cut at
          the sample; frames 1144 to 30164 of 36864 kept unchanged (0.66 s); Ogg Vorbis,
          libvorbis quality 10.

